<title>FRANCE: METALEUROP RAISES ZINC PRICE TO 11,480 FRANCS/T.</title>
<headline>METALEUROP RAISES ZINC PRICE TO 11,480 FRANCS/T.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metaleurop SA, a unit of Preussag AG, said in a statement it had decided to increase its indicative price for Z1 refined zinc of a quality of 99.995 percent to 11,480 francs per tonne from its August 1 price of 10,780.</p>
<p>It said this was due to a rise in the price of zinc on the metal markets and due to the rise of the dollar on the foreign exchanges.</p>
<p>It said the price was ex-factory, cash. The new price starts today.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
